      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63343,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 193,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "<p>The histopathology of fallopian tube adenosarcoma is similar to that of its endometrial counterpart {20179434}. See <a style=\"cursor:pointer\" href=\"/chaptercontent/34/259\" target=\"_blank\">section </a><em>Adenosarcoma of the uterine corpus</em>.</p>",
